al gameplay-wise, and the costumes they receive don't differ from each other in any aspect except aesthetically.\n\nThe costumes include a sweeper, which can suck enemies and turn them into coins, a safari suit that can climb walls and swing from hooks and a cowboy suit that shoots corks and maneuvers by bouncing. The latter two outfits can be upgraded at a shop.\n\nThe Genesis version of the game includes a cosmetic change for the stage 5 boss and an extra room in stage 3.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-great-circus-mystery-starring-mickey-and-minnie", "videos": [{"id": 161938, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "_7Iu_GOxsE0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_7Iu_GOxsE0", "title": "SNES Longplay [135] Disney's Magical Quest 2: The Great Circus Mystery", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_7Iu_GOxsE0/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 900, "name": "Disney's Magical Quest"}]}